      "category": "Text",
      "text": "DESIGNATION OF THE EMERGENCY MEDICAL SERVICE AS THE\nCOORDINATING AGENCY FOR EMERGENCY MEDICAL CARE FOR\nTHE CITY OF NEW YORK",
